alPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":10054,"title":"","description":"26","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Thriller","History","War"],"id":10054,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Valkyrie","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/shows/58f00874-ccba-4c15-ad81-5902a4805489.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/shows/1ea412e3-be5d-4d9e-a1b4-0b9b96dc37c1.png","likes":220,"dislikes":6,"views":23607,"release_date":"1230163200000","length":7221,"description":"In Nazi Germany during World War II, as the tide turned in favor of The Allies, a cadre of senior German officers and politicians desperately plot to topple the Nazi regime before the nation is crushed in a near-inevitable defeat. To this end, Colonel Claus von Stauffenberg, an Army officer convinced he must save Germany from Hitler, is recruited to mastermind a real plan. To do so, he arranges for the internal emergency measure, Operation: Valkyrie, to be changed to enable his fellows to seize control of Berlin after the assassination of the Fuhrer. However, even as the plan is put into action, a combination of bad luck and human failings conspire on their own to create a tragedy that would prolong the greater one gripping Europe.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":10054,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}